``` OTD-0008 - DNP3 disable unsolicited responses ```
``` Library: OT Threat Content  |  Legacy ID: OT-UC-0008 ```
``` ATT&CK for ICS: T0804  |  Severity: High ```
``` Detection logic: Detects DNP3 function code 21 (Disable Unsolicited Responses), which can be abused to suppress event/alarm reporting from an outstation to the master, masking subsequent malicious activity. ```
``` STATUS: SCAFFOLD - complete and validate before deployment. ```
index=ot_network sourcetype=zeek:dnp3 earliest=-24h
